{"v":4,"catch":"養育你喜歡的小魚，打造你心中的夢幻水下世界！","desc":"這是一個專屬於你的水族箱。你可以購買喜歡的小魚苗，然後養育他們，看著它們慢慢長大，最終打造出你心中的夢幻水下世界。\n\n輕鬆的放置類玩法。即使你在休息，你的魚兒們也會自動成長，在你回來時給你一個驚喜。\n\n讓時間慢下來，舒緩你的心情，欣賞和享受這個你親自打造的水下世界。","publisher":"Happy Player","release":"2025-11-20","genres":["模擬","策略","音樂"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3704f14f4ebcd0381cc5bcd2679618da76f3b0842d6b48d47870275da24e7f46.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8b446cb8d054644ac1af0710659497ad912d436f1ee4cb52074100c607e388a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a35a4222972e18cae2594af0bfc903abc6bb7611b587eb8c52b724b6aa8b1281.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8aee017a827eec63f91fd5040147c8f3972da03f9b581d1cffddf2c07a61f48b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/91e48e7248ae2e2decbef3f408317f9a97ecca53549e2aa8a2c143decb6b5607.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bd9e7dfd4b921b4214c5f255d7e08f27be3acaa00f64cbac06f81ef1f005ada4.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f5002371c000","dlc":[]}